WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.845
One Saturday morning Mom was reading the newspaper.

2
00:00:05.846 --> 00:00:10.043
"A bike race is coming through town," she said.

3
00:00:10.044 --> 00:00:16.927
"More than a hundred riders will race down Main Street!"

4
00:00:16.928 --> 00:00:21.167
"I want to see them speed by," Emmy said.

5
00:00:21.168 --> 00:00:26.816
"I want to see the cool bikes," Harry said.

6
00:00:26.817 --> 00:00:32.367
"When is the race?" Aunt Judy asked.

7
00:00:32.368 --> 00:00:35.966
Mom read the story again.

8
00:00:35.967 --> 00:00:42.187
"Right now!"

9
00:00:42.188 --> 00:00:47.176
Emmy and Harry put on their shoes.

10
00:00:47.177 --> 00:00:50.771
Aunt Judy grabbed her sunglasses.

11
00:00:50.772 --> 00:00:54.260
Mom found the car keys.

12
00:00:54.261 --> 00:00:59.469
Everyone was ready quickly.

13
00:00:59.470 --> 00:01:05.130
"We have just enough time to get there," Mom said.

14
00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:09.023
She held open the front door for everyone.

15
00:01:09.024 --> 00:01:13.570
Suddenly Rover escaped out the door!

16
00:01:13.571 --> 00:01:19.031
"Rover!" Mom shouted. "Come back!"

17
00:01:19.032 --> 00:01:21.992
The Carters called Rover.

18
00:01:21.993 --> 00:01:25.085
But Rover didn't come.

19
00:01:25.086 --> 00:01:30.981
Emmy ran inside for a dog treat.

20
00:01:30.982 --> 00:01:38.439
It took a while to get Rover back in the house.

21
00:01:38.440 --> 00:01:47.117
Mom quickly drove downtown.

22
00:01:47.118 --> 00:01:51.689
She had to park far from the race.

23
00:01:51.690 --> 00:01:55.352
The Carters hurried toward Main Street.

24
00:01:55.353 --> 00:01:58.236
But the race was over!

25
00:01:58.237 --> 00:02:03.897
"We raced to the race but weren't fast enough," Emmy said.

26
00:02:03.898 --> 00:02:07.538
"What should we do now?"

27
00:02:07.539 --> 00:02:12.887
"Let's go home and ride bikes," Aunt Judy said.

28
00:02:12.888 --> 00:02:20.319
"Yes!" Harry said. "We can have our own bike race."

29
00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:28.164
Emmy grinned. "And we won't be late!"

